  "body": "Similar to stuff like:\n\nDOM <img src=\"http://resources.whatwg.org/logo-dom.svg\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\">\n\nEncoding <img src=\"http://resources.whatwg.org/logo-encoding.svg\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\">\n\nNotifications <img src=\"http://resources.whatwg.org/logo-notifications.svg\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\">\n\nFetch <img src=\"http://resources.whatwg.org/logo-fetch.svg\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\">\n\nURL <img src=\"http://resources.whatwg.org/logo-url.svg\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\">\n\n---\n\n@Raynos and others have suggested using a (Mario-like) pipe in a circle. Seems good to me. Wavy water lines or a duplex telephone have also come up.\n",
